@step Preview a suggestion that also selects the IVA category.
@static aeat app ledger classify <transaction-id> --llm --saturate
@blocked external-service Needs the on-host local model runtime and its reader models, which the hermetic sandbox does not run.
@step Apply the saturated suggestion.
@static aeat app ledger classify <transaction-id> --llm --saturate --apply
@blocked external-service Needs the on-host local model runtime and its reader models, which the hermetic sandbox does not run.
